    "lore": "The Dark 'n' Stormy is one of the few trademarked cocktails in existence \u2014 Gosling's Brothers of Bermuda owns the name and stipulates that Gosling's Black Seal rum must be used. The drink became the national drink of Bermuda, where local sailors drank it after long ocean crossings, the dark rum floating dramatically on pale ginger beer like storm clouds over the sea.",
    "pro_tip": "Float the rum on top of the ginger beer rather than mixing it in \u2014 this creates the signature storm cloud effect and a more complex sip.",
    "is_classic": true,
    "steps": [
      "Fill your glass with ice.",
      "Add ingredients in order, finishing with any carbonated components.",
      "Give a single gentle stir to incorporate.",
      "Garnish with lime wedge, candied ginger."
    ],
